    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420540/extras/fd3afc4274cc3f010889cea87e10cad3.avif?t=1745834265\" /></span>Join KAOTIX Fury, his brother Slade, and their two bow-wow companions on a thrilling mission to save the Fennyverse! Dive into a heart-pounding arcade shooter solo or couch co-op, packed with intense battles and unforgettable moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420540/extras/801156bc02c7f291b2efde484770db53.avif?t=1745834265\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A faithful arcade style game with 16 bit graphics and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck support.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XINPUT Support up to two control pads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard controls. (One player can only use the keyboard)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible pixel art from David Jones &amp; Elizabeth Wright.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FM chiptune soundtrack by Glyn Humphreys &amp; Diives, using a software based solution of the YM2612 and the SN76489!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple graphics options such as the CRT shader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colour blind friendly options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 and 120fps mode for smoother gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disable and enable 2-Player anywhere during gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helper buddy system. Keeps multiplayer going instead of ending the players game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple camera options for 1-Player mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer friendly moveable HUD.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lot's of sound options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420540/extras/9d1ff3265d70c88922cb9523781d976b.avif?t=1745834265\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four difficulty levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique areas to traverse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 different enemies types to tackle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 bosses to destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arsenal of 9 weapons to master along with the Mega Bomb, Mines and Melee Roll.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons and speed and compete with the hardest enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 vehicles to control and add to the destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or local co-op with a friend, play online with a friend with Steam Remote Play Together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 18 Cheats in the cheat shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420540/extras/4606060db826aa408f69ed5b02d0afef.avif?t=1745834265\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Mode! with an additional 45 levels. Each planet will have 3 quests to complete, a mini boss and a big boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crisis Mode! Battle in arena based levels, find your friends to help you battle in Original mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Mode! Battle waves of enemies in a\u00a0Vampire Survivors like gameplay style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Rush! Battle all bosses in a row and try to to get to the end with one life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extras shop with loads of fun unlockables.</p></li></ul>",
