ith loads of fun unlockables.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Lock and load. Shoot first, ask questions if you feel like it. Every second counts as you dodge incoming fire, obliterate enemy fleets, and collect power-ups. It\u2019s up to you to take the fight to the enemy, and save the Fennyverse from total annihilation.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cA bow to the Golden Age of the Arcade Era.\u201d<br />\r\nRecommended \u2013 Adult World Gamers<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cA very funny arcade game! 10/10 pixel art. Tasty Chicken :3\u201d<br />\r\nRecommended \u2013 FursaNation<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cPeraglees (The Ooloufian Resistance) is a fun and retro-inspired arcade shooter game with fast-paced gameplay, various weapons and upgrade, intense boss fight, support coop mode.\u201d<br />\r\nRecommended \u2013 Gaming Grandma<br />\r\n",
